WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:05.020
Shower, shower, shower, shower...

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:15.780
You're doing a good job taking care of the garden.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:22.450
Since school is having a spring break, Yume has been doing most of the work.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.010
I see. Yume, huh.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:24.900
Good girl.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.270
It's not a big deal.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:32.840
But to think that club activities and garden tending are the only things I have to do sounds pretty dull, right?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.350
Huh? Did you just say something, Yume?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.280
No, it's nothing.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.060
Yume...

00:00:57.310 --> 00:00:58.410
Pretty...

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.790
Ren, are you able to appreciate this wonderful garden?

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.000
Shinra-sama?

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:06.430
Oh...

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.250
You're late!

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.000
I-I'm sorry.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:02.510
Therefore, I'm responsible for making Shinra-sama upset.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:08.950
Don't be too concerned. Until you get used to things, it can't be helped.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.290
It's hot!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.800
Are you okay?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.780
It's hot!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.800
You... you... you... you... you... you... you... you...

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.800
Miyu-san, calm down! You need medical attention!

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:29.180
Here, cool yourself with a popsicle.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.680
Miyu-chan, you're a good girl.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.610
Causing injury to your master.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:49.460
Although it's Miyu's fault for being out of character by acting like an adult and ordering hot tea...

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.120
You're a failure as a butler.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.630
Argh!

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:01.530
Shinra-sama, in order to indoctrinate this failure on what it takes to become a butler...

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.760
I ask for permission to take him to the training camp.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.990
That tropical island, huh.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.890
Very well.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.520
Oh my God.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.560
Ren-chan is going to be banished to an island?

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.290
The feeling of not being able to see Ren-chan...

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.190
No, he's  going to be taken to a tropical island for training.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.610
Doves will die when they become sad.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.240
You mean rabbits, right?

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:27.580
A tropical island, huh. That sounds fun.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.810
I bet there's lots of delicious food.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:33.160
Since it's my spring break, Yume wants to go somewhere, too.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.800
Then, let's all go together.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.210
Huh?

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.820
Shinra-sama...

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.920
Chiharu, eavesdropping is not a commendable act.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:45.800
Colonel, I knew you would recognize my existence!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.320
Are you supposed to be elated?!

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.180
Yes!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.270
Everybody check the expiration date of your passports.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.630
As for you, Ren and Mihato.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:53.980
I don't have one.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.730
I'll take care of it at once.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.120
A trip overseas.

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.610
It's my the first time!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:03.000
Yay! I'm going on a trip with everyone!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:11.660
Blue sky, blue sea, white beach...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.800
And right beside me, wearing a swimsuit is...

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.580
What are you doing here?

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:21.000
I wanted to share this natural beauty with you, Anii.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:25.000
Wow, it sure is a wonderful sight, isn't it?

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.690
There's not even a single piece of litter.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:29.050
That's not what you're supposed to be moved about!

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.390
Good work.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.900
I wonder if it's too plain?

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.670
It looks wonderful on you, Yume Ojou-sama.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.530
No, no, not yet.

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:47.910
W-What the heck is this?

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.570
Pandas are my favorite item, what else?

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:54.990
Shinra-sama...

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.440
Hurry up and blow it.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.370
Huh? Oh...

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:04.920
A-At once!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:07.920
Do you want me to help?

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:10.720
No, this is my job.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.860
Are you sure?

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.730
Yume, let's play.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.090
Yeah, she's definitely not the ordinary type.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:26.190
Hey, brute, what are you looking at with those perverted eyes?

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.210
Huh?

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:28.190
Don't look this way!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.870
Not that you have anything to brag about.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.590
Whoa, that's low!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.200
I bet you were imagining what was underneath!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.590
Ren-chan!

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.210
Huh?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.270
How is my new swimsuit?

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.660
Hato-nee, anything you wear is perfect!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.330
Shinra-sama, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.730
Kurukkuu...

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.200
Then, let's go.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.440
I will accompany you.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.530
Nee-san.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.270
Where did you hide my swimsuit?

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:08.280
Resistance is futile.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:23.020
Don't look.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:33.100
Ah yes, that one definitely looks best on you, Miyu-tan.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.590
I'll give you this as well.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:38.670
Nee-san, I'm an adult in her twenties, you know!

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.260
Give back my sexy bikini!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:44.870
For the time being you're on leave, so have fun.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:46.380
All right!

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.610
Nee-san, you better show more self-restraint!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.400
Great, I'm going to swim.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.520
Not so easy.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.410
Ren, you come with me.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.000
The stage has been set and this is what I get?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.700
How unfortunate, just when I was thinking of having fun with you.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.880
Yeah, like you really mean it.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.990
So, Benisu, I'm leaving the rest up to you.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:13.880
Yes.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.060
"The Butler's Den"?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.780
What a creepy name.

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:22.020
What are you talking about?

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:29.150
This is a special butler training facility only for those who serve prominent families.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.650
First of all, sign this.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:33.430
This is...

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.160
I-I can't read it.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:38.450
Well, it's something like a guest manifest.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.240
Rest assured, I won't sell it to the Foreign Legion.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:45.790
Editor's note: The Foreign Legion is a unit of the French Army which historically housed foreign volunteers.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:45.770
Who's going to worry about something outlandish as that?

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:54.560
A-Ageha-sama!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.300
That voice is...

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.020
I brought you your tea.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.350
You're late.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:11.470
You dolt, how can you call yourself a butler to the Kuki family?

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:12.780
Shame on you!

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.490
I can't take it, my courage is withering...

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.010
It's no surprise, undergoing that kind of torture.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.990
I will happily accept my punishment.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:27.990
But, not to be punched by Ageha-sama is more than I can stand!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:31.560
Kojuurou...

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.790
Ageha-sama.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:36.880
Huh? Ah, Tajiri-dono.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.180
And is he the newcomer to the Kuonji family?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.260
Yes, Ageha-sama.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.680
Is it okay for us to join your training?

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:47.350
Tajiri-dono, you're more than welcome.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.250
Thank you very much.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:52.360
Ren, let's begin without further ado.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.400
You must use water right out of the faucet.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.260
The point of this is for it to contain plenty of air.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.660
As soon as it boils, pour it into the teapot.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:04.990
Ren, look at this.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.270
The tea leaves are dancing!

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.790
It feels good for some reason.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.170
I feel like I'm melting.

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.740
I'm going to color it with my hue.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.090
Aw, my existence will be diluted.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:24.060
This is what is known as jumping. This way, the leaves will open in order to fully extract taste and aroma.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.010
You're right. The aroma is completely different.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.190
T-This is...

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.900
Wonderful!

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.540
This is your assignment for the entry level.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.570
Do it.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.140
Piece of cake, piece of cake.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:39.900
Watch me.

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.580
You idiot, what were you listening to?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:43.780
Dekopin.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.740
Hey, you geezer!

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:51.830
If you do this to me every time I fail, I'll die before I can make tea!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.420
That's from a while ago...

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.550
"I fully acknowledge that whatever training I partake in will be at my own risk."

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:02.740
"In the event that I lose my life, so be it, as it is my death wish."

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:03.890
"Uesugi Ren."

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:07.100
See, this is your signature.

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:09.770
You duped me, Colonel!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:17.190
This is a training method designed to bring out your potential by testing your limits.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:20.190
Come on, show me how serious you are!

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:24.040
You wimp, don't you have any balls?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.590
You better run for your life, you swine!

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.750
Sir! Yes, Sir!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.210
Then, put this on. I'll mend your laid-back mentality into shape!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:40.510
Ren-chan...

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:45.110
Ren, you're going to become a star butler!

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:47.370
Colonel, I'm going to do it!

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:00.000
Rule No. 1 for tomorrow:

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:04.370
Don't make your elbow leave the left side of your body, and push forward at an interior angle.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.740
Ageha-sama...

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.140
Good. Next.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:08.240
Y-Yes.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.570
I don't think this will be of any help.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:14.390
Don't underestimate a kata.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:19.300
Editor's note: A kata is a specific movement pattern commonly pertaining to martial arts, but kabuki theatre and tea ceremonies as well.

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:18.500
Once your body can respond naturally, you can tend to matters at hand.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:23.490
Um, such matters at hand is completely wrong.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.250
300 pushups.

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:30.230
Sigh, I bet everyone's enjoying their vacation by now.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:31.070
You're late.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.270
Ageha-sama!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:38.500
Since there are scarier monsters overseas than in Japan, don't let down your guard.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.570
W-What kind of monsters?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.680
Um, for instance...

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.530
Drop dead.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:50.910
Translator's note: She is "Bearko", the daughter of "Backbeard", and that is a signature line of Backbeard (see http://blog8.fc2.com/t/torotei/file/backbeard.htm).

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:50.910
You bunch of lolicons!

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.870
That's not funny.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:56.920
I'm bored.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.860
Then you shouldn't have let Benisu go out and play.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:03.880
I'm not going to play along with Nee-san's sexual harassment today.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.880
In that case, let's drink.

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:10.950
Treating me like an adult for a change.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.390
What are you planning to do once you get me drunk?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.070
I can't live without this!

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:33.160
It's too much of a hassle to drink it on the rocks.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:41.870
Natose-san, hurry up and come back.

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:57.390
I can't get enough of this elegant sound!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.210
You're amazing, Beni!

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.740
Come on, I'm going for pay dirt!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.410
Bull's-eye!

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.570
Wow! As they say, money makes the world go around!

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:17.500
Beni, let's cash the chips and head back.

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:19.790
You're out of your mind.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:24.520
You have to double down here, since my capital has increased and this is where the fun starts.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:25.800
B-But...

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.400
Since I'm going to continue to clean up, I'll treat you.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.840
So, bear with me for a just a little while.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.350
Really? Can I order more?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.660
Yes, as you please.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.770
Okay, good luck, Beni!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.270
Leave it to me!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.780
A-Ageha-sama!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.890
Are you finished already?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:55.740
You disappoint me, for not being able to satisfy me.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.910
This burning sensation isn't going to subside.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.330
A-Ageha-san, what are you doing?

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:04.530
Since Kojuurou passed out, I'm going to deal with you.

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.300
T-There's no need for you to...

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.510
You're unexpectedly well built.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.550
That's too fast.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.310
Kojuurou made it to 300.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.360
299... 300...

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.510
301...

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:26.570
I commend you for doing it to the end.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.580
Here is your reward.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:35.850
Glucose will turn into energy, so you can continue concentrating on your training.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:38.220
Thank you very much.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.560
Shinra-sama.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:51.670
Beni-kou is probably attending to Shinra-sama without any problems.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.680
My money is...

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.010
Come on, let's go.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.470
Stare.

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:06.690
N-No, my money is for the food I just ate.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.670
Are you telling me to go back as a loser?

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.190
Ladies.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:13.990
Allow us to provide you with funds.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:17.240
Beni, don't tell me that you're thinking of continuing in debt.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:21.500
Where's the switch?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.000
It's here!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.500
Oh, it's Ren-kun...

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.990
I thought you were a monster!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:32.760
That's not normal thinking.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:37.470
The mere thought of a monster appearing is so terrifying, I can't sleep.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.700
I think I should get something to drink.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.880
Here, this is yours, Ren-kun.

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.770
Thank you very much.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.110
You're welcome.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:49.860
To be training till this late is impressive.

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:56.010
I became relieved and sleepy just by seeing you, Ren-kun.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.780
I'm going back to bed.

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:59.570
Good night.

00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:01.000
Huh?

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:07.240
Miyu-san, where are you going dressed like that?

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.770
Why am I doing this?

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:17.170
Since you're a personal attendant, it's normal to bathe together.

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:20.010
It's not often I get to see you intoxicated, Miyu-san.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.590
Did anything happen?

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:26.270
Grown up women have their secrets, you know.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.010
Hey, don't face this way!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.020
No, you can't!

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.200
I feel sick!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.990
Miyu-san, no!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.020
Oh, it's you, Ren.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:55.020
Um... I just...

00:17:56.640 --> 00:18:00.500
There's no way you have the guts to make an advance towards me, Ren.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:01.580
This must be a dream.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.090
Please don't make fun of me.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.680
Shall I test you?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.690
G-Go ahead.

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:15.830
Just because you failed doesn't mean that I'm tired of you and will throw you out.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.250
Since you're already mine.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:25.370
Come on, show me your private parts and your pathetic features.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.230
Shinra-sama.

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:29.870
You're so cute.

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:33.100
Ah, I can't get enough of this cuddly sensation!

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:35.880
It's an ecstacy of black and white.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:40.380
Classic Shinra-sama... even in her dazed state, she's larger than life.

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:49.420
Ren-chan.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.190
Hato-nee, were you watching me?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:57.340
Everyone was feeling lonely since you left, Ren-chan.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:01.780
When I wasn't even around until recently.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.260
Strange, isn't it?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.370
And I only had you, Hato-nee.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.110
You're right.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.250
Where have you been?

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.770
To my master's side.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.780
Brew some tea.

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:53.290
Hm, you've made progress in such a short period.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.350
Please.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.090
Oh, so you came back.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.130
Ageha-sama, this is for you.

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.020
Huh? What is this?

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:07.680
T-This is...

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:13.190
The subtle taste of salt... it's as if I was embraced by Mother Nature.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.740
Why did you decide to serve her kelp tea?

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:23.360
Since Ageha-sama was perspiring while attending to Kojuurou's
training, I felt it was essential to replenish her sodium supply.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:27.410
I see. So, you chose it on account of my physical condition, huh.

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:30.520
A mindset most deserving of praise!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:32.230
I shall reward you.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.870
What do you desire?

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:36.580
Your smile is more than enough.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.290
My...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:44.540
Kid, you're getting the knack on mastering what it is to become a butler.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.710
You've just graduated from the entry level.

00:20:46.710 --> 00:20:47.720
Really?

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:52.000
Great, I'm going to make morning tea for Miyu-san!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:58.000
One of these days, you're going to show me what you're made of.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.550
Uesugi Ren, huh.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:05.870
You tickle my fancy.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.360
Kojuurou, we're going back to Japan!

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:15.000
Ma'am!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.380
Ren, it's really delicious.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.430
Thank you very much.

00:21:28.670 --> 00:21:30.430
Shinra-sama, this is for you.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:32.930
If I'm not mistaken, you like it in a bottle.

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:39.000
You're finally able to prepare things before I ask you to.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.940
You did an excellent job in training him, Colonel.

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:44.000
The reason why he was able to show such progress is because...

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:48.000
Both of you possess the qualities of a master.

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:50.060
Yume doesn't have it then...

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:50.780
Huh?

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:53.990
Well, Natose-san always tends to you, Yume Ojou-sama...

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:56.160
Speaking of which, where's Natose-san?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.960
Ever since she left with Benisu-san last night, they haven't come back.

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.500
What?!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.960
When I was putting my life on the life for training?

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:08.160
That carefree Beni-kou, playing out all night...

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:14.720
If  you don't have any money, then I'll have you pay it with your body.

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:17.910
There's no need for you to stare.

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:21.730
You've only to blame yourself for being out of luck.

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:26.840
Do we have to get serious?

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:31.010
If you get serious, things will only get more complicated.

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:32.610
Okay.

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:33.450
Beni!

00:22:40.370 --> 00:22:44.020
I'm warning you, I'm not cheap, you know.

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:15.160
The next episode of Kimiaru will be a recap!

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:18.480
Wrong! It's my main story!

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:21.730
Look forward to seeing nothing but me in Episode 5!

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:23.730
And where's the punch line?

00:24:23.730 --> 00:24:24.980
There isn't any!
